Name Rio Note - News #2 Abandonment

Interactability_Text_Line_0 World Paper News
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Rio Internationals 2 years later: In disrepair and forgotten.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Anonymous reports sent to the World Paper by residents of the city of Rio de Janeiro suggest that the infrastructure built for the 2016 Internationals in Rio has been falling into disrepair ever since the event ended.